## Fix round 2 (approved by the user; $0 part done by a sub-agent, 2026-10-24)
Plan: `fix_round2_plan.md`.
- **64 no-question blocks: a wiring bug, not the window.** The K3 facts still called v3's `ask_first_yes`; fix round 1
